p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "track <what.words> from the terminal => concept tool.purpose \"<what>\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "the first argument names the habit to print => fact input.habit \"the first argument names the habit to print\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "read the habit log from the file named as the second argument, or from standard input when no file is named => fact input.source \"the second argument names a log file, otherwise standard input\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "each log line holds an iso date and a habit name separated by a tab => fact log.format \"an ISO date and a habit name separated by a tab\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "print one character per day from the log's earliest date to its latest date => fact render.days \"one character per day from the earliest to the latest date\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "mark a day the named habit was logged with <mark> => fact mark.present \"<mark>\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "mark a day it was not logged with <mark> => fact mark.absent \"<mark>\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8 stated "install the tool as the command <name> => fact tool.command \"<name>\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
p9 meta lang.pattern.p9 stated "given the log of <d1> for \"<h1>\", <d2> for <h2> and <d3> for \"<h3>\", the habit <q> prints <out> => fact witness.<q>.prints \"<d1> <h1> <d2> <h2> <d3> <h3> <q> <out>\"" @gen:b7d37100c274b993
